# The character classes are not decoration: a .gitignore is case-sensitive,
# and written as `**/*token*` it let API_TOKEN.txt or Secret.json through.
# Checked with `git check-ignore -v`.
**/*[Tt][Oo][Kk][Ee][Nn]*
**/*[Ss][Ee][Cc][Rr][Ee][Tt]*
# An OAuth token is not called "token" anywhere, so the two patterns above
# let it through untouched. The credentials live in ~/.config/environment.d/,
# outside the repo and one per file; the envvars.conf next to them IS
# versioned, and that is why they are kept apart. This is the safety net in
# case the whole directory is ever dragged in.
**/*[Oo][Aa][Uu][Tt][Hh]*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*.gpg
**/*.kdbx
