home/.config/hypr/hypridle.conf
# The LIVE language file of the lock screen. It is seeded by copying
# language.es.conf or language.en.conf over it, and those two ARE versioned.
# Without this line, './install.sh --lang en' wrote inside the repo itself
# -in --link mode, ~/.config/hypr IS the repo- and left git dirty.
home/.config/hypr/language.conf
# Same thing, for the same reason: the switch in Ajustes > Apariencia > Efectos
# (Settings > Appearance > Effects) writes it every time you touch it, and in
# --link mode that lands inside the repo. The defaults already live, versioned,
# in hyprland.lua, so nothing is lost here: if the file is missing,
# hyprland.lua is in charge.
home/.config/hypr/efectos.lua
# The keyboard of each machine, for the same reason: install.sh writes it from
# what localectl reports, and in --link mode that lands inside the repo. If it
# is missing, the layout written in hyprland.lua is in charge.
home/.config/hypr/keyboard.lua
# And the same with the Qt palettes: qt-pywal.py rewrites them on EVERY
# wallpaper change (its own header says "no editar a mano", do not edit by
# hand). The qt5ct.conf/qt6ct.conf next to them ARE versioned: they are real
# settings -dialogs, typography- and the script only rewrites the four keys
# of them that the palette needs in order to apply
# (color_scheme_path, custom_palette, style and icon_theme).
home/.config/qt5ct/colors/
home/.config/qt6ct/colors/
# kdeglobals, on the other hand, IS versioned even though the same script
# rewrites it: besides colours it carries the desktop fonts and the file
# dialog settings, which ARE part of the rice. The price is that in --link
# mode it will show up as modified after every wallpaper change; what is in
# the repo is the seed a fresh install starts from.
home/.config/poke-theme/state
home/.config/spicetify/config-xpui.ini

home/.config/vlc/vlc-qt-interface.conf
# The file manager bookmarks point to HIS folders: uni, ia-local, other.
# A stranger would get three broken entries, and we would be telling them how
# his home is organised into the bargain. If some day a generic version is to
# be published (Descargas, Imagenes, Videos, dotfiles), let it be a file
# written on purpose for that and not the copy from this machine.
home/.config/gtk-3.0/bookmarks

